  <p>Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you click and purchase, we may earn a small commission at no extra cost to you. We only recommend products we have tested and trust.</p>
  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>Ad networks use cookies to serve relevant ads. You may opt out of personalized advertising at <a href="https://optout.networkadvertising.org">optout.networkadvertising.org</a>.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Send questions to [email placeholder].</p>
</BaseLayout>